  "limitations": [
    "The models receive identical edges but execute different equations and numbers of edge stages.",
    "The full 24-cell grid uses one graph seed per cell; three graph seeds with a fixed model state cover only N=8192,k=32,64,128.",
    "The k=64 advantage is only 1.2-1.6% and should be remeasured after any environment or kernel change.",
    "Graph construction, transfer, backward, training throughput and multi-graph batching are excluded.",
    "No task accuracy, molecule/protein transfer, chirality or force quality is evaluated in this packet.",
    "The topology amendment occurred after initial timing inspection; initial outputs are retained and labeled exploratory."
